  characterName: Kofi Mensah
  promptText: Local miners offer immediate food money if I stay silent about river
    contamination. Accepting feeds my children now but lets pollution persist; exposing
    the harm can protect the wider community but I risk losing urgent supplies.
  leftAnswer: Accepting money can feed your children when hunger is immediate and
    pressing.
  rightAnswer: Speaking out can protect many from harm, even if it brings short-term
    hardship.
